WEBVTT

1
00:00:00.000 --> 00:00:03.330
The word "biodynamic" may be quickly misinterpreted.

2
00:00:05.740 --> 00:00:08.490
The way I would like you to interpret it in relation

3
00:00:08.530 --> 00:00:09.340
to my course,

4
00:00:10.060 --> 00:00:13.200
is that I explain ontogenetic developmental

5
00:00:13.240 --> 00:00:13.720
movement.

6
00:00:15.220 --> 00:00:17.510
This is what I call biodynamics,

7
00:00:17.550 --> 00:00:19.121
the dynamics of life.

8
00:00:19.440 --> 00:00:22.290
And how, somehow, it is organized by a creative

9
00:00:22.330 --> 00:00:22.880
genius,

10
00:00:22.910 --> 00:00:25.670
which can give rise to a kind of emergence of

11
00:00:25.710 --> 00:00:27.669
originality, like that, which appears.

12
00:00:28.047 --> 00:00:30.247
It's quite wonderful, ultimately.

13
00:00:31.267 --> 00:00:34.007
Now, you know, I think, a complement to the

14
00:00:34.047 --> 00:00:35.537
craniosacral system,

15
00:00:36.117 --> 00:00:38.877
which was perhaps simply anatomical at first,

16
00:00:38.907 --> 00:00:42.177
which now perhaps becomes embryological and dynamic.

